{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "友", "id": "友"}, {"form": "因", "id": "因"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "沓", "id": "沓"}, {"form": "法", "id": "法"}, {"form": "獲", "id": "獲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "先", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 2.027173113134079, "source": "先", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 3.8189325823621343, "source": "先", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.8730224333068208, "source": "先", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "先", "target": "沓"}, {"weight": 1.58534036085504, "source": "誠", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.6690496289808848, "source": "心", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "獲", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.1798752527468754, "source": "獲", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.1798752527468754, "source": "上", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.3081069585961433, "source": "法", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.1798752527468754, "source": "法", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "王", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 2.027173113134079, "source": "王", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.8730224333068208, "source": "王", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "王", "target": "沓"}, {"weight": 2.4326382212422435, "source": "因", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.58534036085504, "source": "因", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.9367156180185177, "source":